1
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:07,905
You know how it goes.

2
00:00:07,955 --> 00:00:13,150
A big show is announced, the link goes live, and minutes later it's sold out.

3
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:18,615
By evening, the same tickets are on WhatsApp and X for three times the price.

4
00:00:18,665 --> 00:00:20,650
Bots and touts win.

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,260
Real fans lose.

6
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:26,440
Kovenra sells one ticket per verified person.

7
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,059
Here's a drop.

8
00:00:28,109 --> 00:00:30,325
A fan asks for a ticket.

9
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:35,656
Self confirms they're a real, unique person, without showing their passport.

10
00:00:35,706 --> 00:00:41,747
They pay in dollars or naira over x402, and the ticket lands on their phone.

11
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:44,009
Everything on this board is live.

12
00:00:44,059 --> 00:00:47,526
The naira rate comes straight from Textile FX.

13
00:00:47,576 --> 00:00:50,418
The Celo block ticks by every second.

14
00:00:50,468 --> 00:00:56,220
And these are Kovenra's own totals, including every bot it has turned away.

15
00:00:56,070 --> 00:01:01,128
One person, one ticket, counted per human, not per account.

16
00:01:01,178 --> 00:01:04,315
Naira lands with the organizer in seconds.

17
00:01:04,365 --> 00:01:06,986
Each QR works once at the door.

18
00:01:07,036 --> 00:01:10,148
Bots are refused before any money moves.

19
00:01:10,198 --> 00:01:14,550
And verified AI agents can buy for the person behind them.

20
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:19,507
For shows that would sell out in seconds, organizers can run a Fair Drop.

21
00:01:19,557 --> 00:01:24,544
Instead of a race the fastest bot wins, verified people enter a draw.

22
00:01:24,594 --> 00:01:29,510
One entry each, however many phones or agents they use.

23
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:34,026
When entries close, the hash of the next Celo block picks the winners.

24
00:01:34,076 --> 00:01:39,467
Nobody can know it in advance, not even us, and anyone can check it.

25
00:01:39,517 --> 00:01:47,201
Every event gets a public fairness report: real people served, bots turned away, and every transaction.

26
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,662
Can't make it?

27
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:50,624
Hand your ticket back.

28
00:01:50,674 --> 00:01:58,540
The next verified fan buys it at the original price, your old QR stops working, and your money comes back automatically.

29
00:01:58,590 --> 00:02:04,340
A Kovenra ticket can never sell above face value, so touts have nothing to gain.

30
00:02:04,190 --> 00:02:07,153
For organizers, it takes a minute.

31
00:02:07,203 --> 00:02:11,099
Set a naira price, the seats, and the rules.

32
00:02:11,149 --> 00:02:18,452
Watch sales, naira received, and blocked bots live, and scan tickets at the door with your phone.

33
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,972
Listing is free.

34
00:02:20,022 --> 00:02:25,817
Fill one short form, switch on verified humans or a Fair Drop, and share your link.

35
00:02:25,867 --> 00:02:30,930
Fans pay in dollars or naira, and you always receive naira.

36
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:39,110
Kovenra is an agent itself, registered on ERC-8004 as agent ten thousand one hundred and thirty-seven on Celo mainnet.

37
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:46,630
Any agent with a Self Agent ID can find events, pay the 402, and bring its human a ticket.
